onra tekrar dondurmayınız. Tavsiye edilen tüketim tarihi (TETT) ve parti numarası (L) ambalajın üzerindedir. Ürünlerimiz domuzdan elde edilen katkı maddesi içermez. EN: COCOA, PISTACHIO FLAVOURED AND VANILLA FLAVOURED VEGETABLE FAT ICE CREAM. Ingredients: COCOA VEGETABLE FAT ICE CREAM (33,4%): Water, whey concentrate or whey powder (milk product), sugar, condensed skimmed milk or skimmed milk powder, cow milk, vegetable fat (in varying proportions palm, cotton, canola, sunflower), glucose syrup (com), cocoa powder (2,6%), emulsifier (mono - and diglycerides of fatty acids), stabilizers (guar gum, locust bean gum, sodium carboxymethyl cellulose, Carrageenan) flavouring PISTACHIO FLAVOURED VEGETABLE FAT ICE CREAM (33.3%): Water, whey concentrate or whey powder (milk product), sugar, condensed skimmed milk or skimmed",
